## Implementation Details

The Analytics component is correctly positioned in the component tree:
```
ThemeProvider
  └─ SmoothScroll
      └─ PreloaderWrapper
          ├─ Cursor
          ├─ RouterProvider (handles all routes)
          ├─ Analytics ← Tracks all page views
          └─ ToastContainer
```

This placement ensures that:
- Analytics tracks all routes managed by the RouterProvider
- The component initializes after the app is fully mounted
- Page view events are captured for all navigation

## Next Steps for Deployment

To enable analytics data collection:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel (`vercel deploy`)
2. Navigate to your Vercel dashboard
3. Select your project and go to the Analytics section
4. Click "Enable" to activate Web Analytics
5. After deployment, verify the implementation by checking the browser's Network tab for requests to `/<unique-path>/view`

